    'contact form' => '联系表单',
    'Who we are' => '关于我们',
    'BrickAtlas.shop ("BrickAtlas", "we") is an independent LEGO® set catalogue and price comparison site. The data controller is {operator}. You can reach us through the {contact}.' => 'BrickAtlas.shop（“BrickAtlas”或“我们”）是一个独立的 LEGO® 套装目录和比价网站。数据控制者为 {operator}。您可以通过{contact}与我们联系。',
    'What data we collect' => '我们收集哪些数据',
    'Contact form: your name, email address and message. We use them only to reply to you and keep them no longer than needed to handle your request.' => '联系表单：您的姓名、电子邮箱和留言。我们仅用于回复您，保存时间不超过处理请求所需。',
    'User account (optional): email address, username and the settings, reviews and lists you save. You can ask us to delete your account at any time.' => '用户账户（可选）：电子邮箱、用户名以及您保存的设置、评价和清单。您可以随时要求删除账户。',
    'Analytics: we use Google Analytics 4 to understand how the site is used (pages viewed, approximate location, device type). Google may set cookies for this purpose.' => '统计分析：我们使用 Google Analytics 4 了解网站的使用情况（浏览页面、大致位置、设备类型）。Google 可能为此设置 Cookie。',
    'Advertising: some pages show ads served by Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show and measure ads, including personalised ads where permitted. You can manage ad personalisation at adssettings.google.com.' => '广告：部分页面展示由 Google AdSense 投放的广告。Google 及其合作伙伴可能使用 Cookie 投放和衡量广告，在允许的情况下包括个性化广告。您可以在 adssettings.google.com 管理广告个性化设置。',
    'Server logs: our hosting provider records technical data such as IP address, browser and requested URL to keep the service secure and working. Logs are kept for a limited time.' => '服务器日志：我们的托管服务商会记录 IP 地址、浏览器和请求的网址等技术数据，以保障服务安全和正常运行。日志仅保存有限时间。',
    'Cookies' => 'Cookie',
    'We use essential cookies (session, security token, language choice) as well as analytics and advertising cookies from Google. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site works without analytics and advertising cookies.' => '我们使用必要的 Cookie（会话、安全令牌、语言选择）以及 Google 的统计和广告 Cookie。您可以在浏览器设置中阻止或删除 Cookie；没有统计和广告 Cookie 网站也能正常使用。',
    'Affiliate links' => '联盟链接',
    'Some links to stores are affiliate links. When you click one and make a purchase, the store or affiliate network (for example Rakuten Advertising or Tradedoubler) may set its own cookie to attribute the sale, and we may earn a commission. This does not change the price you pay. The store\'s own privacy policy applies once you leave BrickAtlas.' => '部分商店链接为联盟链接。当您点击并购买时，商店或联盟网络（例如 Rakuten Advertising 或 Tradedoubler）可能设置其自己的 Cookie 以归属该笔销售，我们可能因此获得佣金。这不会改变您支付的价格。离开 BrickAtlas 后，适用相应商店的隐私政策。',
    'Legal basis and sharing' => '法律依据与数据共享',
    'Your rights' => '您的权利',
    'Under the GDPR you have the right to access, correct, delete or restrict processing of your data, to object to processing, and to data portability. To exercise these rights, contact us through the {contact}. You may also lodge a complaint with the Polish data protection authority (Prezes Urzędu Ochrony Danych Osobowych, uodo.gov.pl) or your local supervisory authority.' => '根据 GDPR，您有权访问、更正、删除或限制处理您的数据，有权反对处理，并享有数据可携带权。如需行使这些权利，请通过{contact}与我们联系。您也可以向波兰数据保护机构（Prezes Urzędu Ochrony Danych Osobowych，uodo.gov.pl）或您所在地的监管机构投诉。',
